<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13113" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολογ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>speech in defence,</i> opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατηγορία,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				6.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				28a
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ποιεῖσθαι</span> to
			make <i>a defence,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Is.
				6.62
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ποιεῖσθαι τὸν ἑαυτοῦ βίον τῶν τοῦ
					πατρὸς ἀδικημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					14.29
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν κατηγορηθέντων τὸ μὴ λαβὸν
					ἀπολογίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hyp.
					<u>Eux.</u>
					31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τοῦ εὐαγγελίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Phil.</u>
					1.16
				</span></i>
			; expl. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληροφορία,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
